Max change log (1996)
=====================

VERSION HISTORY
---------------
12/19/96 Max 0.31
	implemented MN_PATH_CELL (linked C and Tcl cell paths)

12/19/96 Max 0.30
	moved "erase layers" to Shift-Button-3
	fixed bug in edit_push
	fixed bug in sel_labels
	finished implementation and debugged ":select -editOnly"

12/18/96 Max 0.29x
	Cleaned up file menu functionality.
	Implemented "File/Copy Cell" and "Edit/Delete Cell"
	implemented db_cell_rename 
	User given file box for renaming when saving (UNNAMED).	
	rmed some old Magic bindings
	cleaned up menus.
	fixed so don't zoom out when poping edit cell.
	feeding back coords during box drag now.

12/17/96 Max 0.28x
	fixed "sel_net space" bug
	fixed "DBSeeTypes() bug that broke ":select -g -editOnly"
	implemented db_cell_delete and db_copy_cell

12/10/96 Max 0.27x
	new improved palette.
	sel_group_transfer command.

12/9/96 Max 0.26x
	bug fixes.
	label and port kind ids now prepended to text.

12/8/96 Max 0.25x
	sel_net command.
	label "kinds", including ports, implemented.
	changed redisplay to display labels only when attached layers are vis.
	sel_label enhanced to do area searches (and handle label kinds).
	added -no_default option to lay_point to return {} when point invalid.

12/5/96	Max 0.24x
	 Sue like list boxes implemented
	 Sue like mouse buttons implemented
	 file menu commands improved to always set edit cell.
	 push/pop/edit in place implemented
	 "Improved" Menus and more hot keys.

	 Better Menus

12/3/96 Max 0.23x
	 x = experimental (installed as maxx at Micromagic).
	 Implemented group "classes" and attributes.
	 Converted to .max format
	 Implemented db_magic read ...
	 Implemented reading/writing of flylines and groups and label flags.
	 Blew away "moving label" warning.
	 Implemented -editOnly option for "select area"
	 Fixed group_transfer proc using above.
	 Made palette compact.
	 Implemented new menus and hotkeys.
	 Coded stub for list_box stuff.

11/17/96 Max 0.22
	 Moved flyline display to highlights.
	 Added "-more" flag to sel_labels.  (:see [no] hiddenLabels)
	 Added "hidden" flag for labels.
	 Fixed group bug.

11/13/96 Max 0.21
	 Implements flylines.
	 Fixed menu scanning.

10/28/96 Max 0.20
	 Implements groups for labels.
	 Incorporates Lee's new wiring code (using groups).
	 wiring tech parms moved to tech_ppc4.tech

10/26/96 Max 0.19
	 Fixed group bugs.
	 Added group_transfer func.
	 compiling -O3
	 stripped executable.

10/23/96 Max 0.18
	 First cross-compiled version.
	 no -ggdb - notice a difference?
	 Implmented groups (painting, db_group, ":select -g ...")
	 Implemented license manager.

9/23/96 Max 0.17
	 added sel_labels command to allow selection of labels by content.

9/19/96 Max 0.16
	 now tech independent: 
	   takes -tech or -T (magic compatible) cmd line option
	   or takes from fileName on cmdline
	   or scmos (default).
	   auxilary tcl tech file in max_lib: tech_<techName>.tcl

	 -geometry on command line fixed.

	 palette now uses pal_group specs in tech_<techName>.tcl
	 added "cif_layers" cmd (gives layers in current cif output style)
	 now generating cif menu from current cif output style.

	 fixed *.mag extension in file selector box

	 coded up tsmc.tech 
	 coded up aux tech files:  tech_ppc4.tcl, tech_tsmc.tcl and tech_scmos.tcl 

	 maxlib tcl var name changed to max_lib

9/13/96 Max 0.15
	 fixed abort on bad file name on command line
	 fixed bug that caused undo info to be lost when drc busy
	 increased length of undo list from 20 to 200
	 fixed problem with magic cmds getting input from command window
	 modified "sel_what labels" to give label positions in English (e.g. NORTH)
	 added "New..." to file menu
	 converted to Lee's new file box (allows <dir> only and ext. scan)

9/2/96	Max 0.14
	 Fixed expand bug (propagating expansion state to selected cells)
	 kludged fix to loss of focus when using file box.
	 accurate -desc to main mode bindings
	 new command:  "db_cell_new [-internal] cellName"

8/29/96	Max 0.13
	 busy/mode/wait/redisplay cursors
	 drc status indicated
	 Window menu allows palette etc to be turned off
	 No longer updating palette on every cursor motion 
		 (created _max_periodic_update)
	 Enhanced ":calma read" to optionally read only specified cellName

8/23/96 Max 0.12
	 Converted to Lee's setl
	 Moved motion binding to main (to not conflict with mode specific bindings)

8/23/96 Max 0.11
	 added command modes.
	 fixed zoom_drag during subedit (again!)

8/9/96	Max 0.10
	 sel_what added "cells" subcommands; instance paths for "cells" and 
	 "labels" results.  "-edit_only var_name" options on "paint", "cells"
	 and "labels" subcommands.

	 cct cif styles, changed gds types to 0.

	 fixed bug in "calma read"

	 fixed zoom_drag during subedit.

8/2/96  Max 0.9
	 Overhauled message handling and error handling.  Now have well 
	 defined: info, warning, 	error, and panic messages.  
	 See (html) manual, and "msg" and "msg_catch"
	 command documentation for details.

	 Fixed ":" command insertion cursor problem (I think).
	 Command box can now be resized.

	 Modified menu_add_cmd to delete (any) preexisting menu item of same name.
	 Added "Resource .maxrc" to File menu.

	 Augmented sel_what (now have "labels" and "paint" subcommands.)

7/22/96 Max 0.8
	 Completed input/output support for CCT tools
	 (cif istyle CCT)
	 Should now be able to write from Magic to CCT and read results back in.
	 Changed default "calma" extension from .strm to .gds but allow alternate
	 extensions to be supplied on ":calma read" and ":calma write"

7/22/96	Max 0.7
	 Support for outputting gds to CCT tools.
	 (cif ostyle cct)
	 enhanced ":calma write" to be able to output unrestricted char-set text,
	 instance bounding boxes, and instance text labels.

7/18/96	Max 0.6
	 "integral" documentation (own version of proc with -desc, and -doc options)
	 Added help menu.
	 help/manual (html manual)
	 help/commands (command documentation browser)

6/27/96	Max 0.5
	 File Box and Cells menu (thanks Lee)
	 Added "drc" (turns drc error display on/off)  and allSame buttons to palette.
	 Fixed (partially) spamming of user with error messages.
	 Lee's drag box zoom
	 Lee's experimental wiring tool.
	 Switched to Lee's exit box.

6/13/96	Max 0.4
	 ppc4/:  
		 tuned display styles
		 debugged/verified drc rules
		 added correct calma layers,
		 added "foreign" drc feedback layer
		 fixed pplus generation
	 added .maxrc sourcing
	 new tcl primitive:  lay_editcell tcl primitive
	 fixed "unexpanded subcell" bug.

6/6/96	Max 0.3
	 box dimension and area display
	 cif layer menu
	 added labels button to palette.
	 implemented Cntl-D (erase layer) from palette

	 new tcl primitives:  "db_search labels", "lay_rootcell"
	 enhanced tcl primitives:   "lab_box" and "lay_point"
	 ppc4.tech:	  improved drc rules, restored cif input/output

	 fixed solaris cif write bug
	 make config (to switch between mmi and mha)

5/30/96	Max 0.2
	 Switched over to ppc4 technology.

5/14/96	Max 0.1		
	 Smart Palette.
	 Last command repeat (.)
	 Undo of toplevel commands.

5/1/96	Max 0.0		maxbu/max0.0May1.tar.gz
	 First real install.
	 First version intended for real use by users.

4/15/96	Max -1.0	maxbu/max.sol.mallocBug.zar
	 First install at MMI under Solaris.
	 Demoware.

1/24/96	Magic 6.4.5.MMI	maxbu/max.base.magic.tar.gz 
	 Base version for Max.

	 Magic 6.4.5 +
	 95jun30 (extractor enhancments) +
	 wrl drc enhancements (integrated by mha) +
	 mha drc additional drc enhancements +
	 checkpoint command (mha) +
	 "align" option on cif "squares" operation (mha) +
	 units cmd (allows user to use either microns or database units) (mha) =
	 MMI Magic.

